\newlabel{fig:comparison_all}{{23}{21}{Side-by-side comparison of $3 \times 3$, $4 \times 4$, and $5 \times 5$ Magic Gems. The odd-even-odd progression reveals structural differences while the zero-covariance property persists}{figure.23}{}}
